  "body": "Resource consent has been approved for two sets of duplexes on this super lot.\r\n\r\nFrom the elevated site, you will enjoy amazing Orewa estuary and sea views whilst knowing you have various bird and wildlife enjoying the surrounding native bush.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none and ideal for those who like walking, running or riding with easy access onto Te Ara Tahuna.  \r\n\r\nThe close proximity to popular Orewa Township, multiple beaches and easy access to the motorway makes this a very desirable lifestyle location!\r\nAlso available is a 1 hectare section, ideal for those wanting to create their forever home in an enviable location.\r\n\r\nPrice will be + GST (if any)\r\nCall today for your perfect piece of Hibiscus Coast paradise.\r\n\r\nFor more information please download the property files within the link",
